#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:5
msgid "Define text at conductor"
msgstr "在导线上定义文本"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining and displaying information text at each "
"`conductor`_."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许在每个 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 上定义和显示信息文本。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:11
msgid "Only `multiline conductors`_ allow text definition."
msgstr "只有 `多线导 <multiline conductors_>`_ 允许文本定义。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:13
msgid "To define the conductor text:"
msgstr "定义导线文本："

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:15
msgid "`Select the conductor`_ which should be edited."
msgstr "`选择应当编辑的导体 <Select the conductor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:16
msgid "`Display conductor properties`_ PopUp window."
msgstr "`播放导体属性 <Display conductor properties_>`_ 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:17
msgid "Go to multiline section from **Type** tab."
msgstr "从 **Type** 标签转到多行区域 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech multiline conductor text section"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 多线导文本部分"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:24
msgid ""
"Choose the desired parameters for text positioning, text content or formula,"
" text size, etc."
msgstr "选择想要的文本定位，文本内容或公式，文本大小等参数。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:25
msgid ""
"Click the check button **Apply properties to all conductor of this "
"potential** if the changes should be applied for all `conductor`_ with "
"common initial or end `terminal`_."
msgstr ""
"单击检查按钮 **将属性应用到此潜力的所有导师** 如果修改应适用于所有人 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 带有共同初始或结束 `端子 "
"<terminal_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:26
msgid "Press **OK** button to save and apply the property changes."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存并应用属性更改 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:30
msgid ""
"For more information about multiline properties, refer to `conductor type "
"properties`_ section."
msgstr "关于多线属性的更多信息，参见 `导体类型属性 <conductor type properties_>`_ 节。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_text.rst:33
msgid ""
"For more information about automatic text definition during conductor "
"creation, refer to `project folio properties`_ section."
msgstr ""
"关于导电器创建期间自动文本定义的更多信息，参见 `project folio属性 <project folio properties_>`_ 节。"
